ading. Most expert ratings call the race a Tossup, though several rate it a Democratic flip. Prediction markets give Cognetti roughly a 70 percent chance. The available polls are older and Democratic-sponsored, showing only narrow leads, so uncertainty remains high heading into the late-October debate.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5916, "margin": 1.42}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6449, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6453, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6734, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.617, "margin": 2.4}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6201, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6673, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6811, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6435, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6763, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6884, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6826, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6869, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.604, "margin": 2.2}]}